<title>AUSTRALIA: CRICKET-TASMANIA 392-6 AT CLOSE V PAKISTAN (299).</title>
<headline>CRICKET-TASMANIA 392-6 AT CLOSE V PAKISTAN (299).</headline>
<dateline>HOBART, Australia 1996-12-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tasmania were 392 for six in reply to Pakistan's first innings total of 299 all out at the close of play on the second day of a four-day match at the Bellerive Oval on Friday.</p>
<p>Scores: Tasmania 392 for six (Jamie Cox 191 not out); Pakistan 299 (Shahid Afridi 80, Mushtaq Ahmed 65, Shaun Young 7-64).</p>
